06. georel without geometry/coordinates — 400 incomplete geo-query
====================================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 183

{
  "detail": "incomplete geo-query: missing geometry, coordinates",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid geo-query",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



--TEARDOWN--
coraineStop
corDbDrop
